<title>NETHERLANDS: Shares in KNP BT rise strongly.</title>
<headline>Shares in KNP BT rise strongly.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in paper and packaging company KNP BT rose strongly in high volume on Wednesday and dealers said the upswing started after U.S. International Paper gained on restructuring news.</p>
<p>KPN BT was almost topping the volume list and rose 2.80 guilders or over 6.5 percent to 45.50 guilders. The current price is only a little below its year-high of 45.90 guilders.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
